{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38541","headline":"送弟东归 · 吴融","name":"送弟东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶持麟笔侍金闺，梦想三年在故溪。\n祖竹定欺檐雪折，穉杉应拂栋云齐。\n谩劳筋力趋丹凤，可有文词咏碧鸡。\n此别更无闲事嘱，北山高处谢猨啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}